  **WHAT IS ESTABLISHED.**  EQUAL FULL-VIEW PROJECTIONS GIVE EQUAL MENUS with exact weights, over every history to depth 7 (179783 histories, 1089 projection keys, zero violations) — the PROJECTION reduction of the MENU function, at finite depth, and GIVEN (H0) for the fifth read (MV7).
